(CASCADIA - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(Players build an ecosystem in the Pacific Northwest with habitat tiles and place) Tj T*
(wildlife tokens on them. Points come from wildlife patterns and from large connected) Tj T*
(habitats.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SETUP) Tj T*
(Each player takes a starter habitat \(3 tiles\). Choose one wildlife scoring card for) Tj T*
(each of the 5 animals: bear, elk, salmon, hawk and fox. Reveal 4 habitat tiles, each) Tj T*
(paired with a wildlife token.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(YOUR TURN) Tj T*
(1. Take one tile and the token paired with it.) Tj T*
(2. Place the tile next to your existing tiles.) Tj T*
(3. You may place the token on one of your tiles that shows that animal and has no) Tj T*
(   token yet.) Tj T*
(   If you can not or do not want to, return it to the bag.) Tj T*
(4. Refill the display.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERPOPULATION) Tj T*
(If the 4 tokens on display are the same animal, they are replaced automatically. If 3) Tj T*
(are the same, the active player may replace those 3 once.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
