(KEYSTONE TILES AND NATURE TOKENS) Tj T*
(Keystone tiles show a single habitat and a single animal. Placing a matching token on) Tj T*
(a keystone tile gives you a nature token. Spend a nature token to take any tile with) Tj T*
(any token from the display, or to replace any number of tokens on display.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(END OF THE GAME) Tj T*
(The game ends after each player has taken 20 turns.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SCORING) Tj T*
(- Wildlife: each animal scores according to its scoring card.) Tj T*
(- Habitats: for each of the 5 habitats, score 1 point per tile in your largest) Tj T*
(   connected area. The) Tj T*
(player with the largest area of a habitat scores 3 bonus points \(2 each on a tie\).) Tj T*
(With 2 players the bonus is 2 points.) Tj T*
(- Each unused nature token: 1 point.) Tj T*
(The most points wins; on a tie, the player with more nature tokens wins.) Tj T*
ET
